# The npm mirror (registry.npmmirror.com) lags behind for freshly published
# native binaries of the oxc tools, e.g. @oxlint/binding-win32-x64-msvc@1.88.0
# is not synced yet. A missing platform binary is silently skipped as an
# optional dependency, which leaves oxlint/oxfmt unable to run.
# Resolve these two scopes from the official registry so the binaries are
# always complete; every other package keeps using the mirror.
@oxlint:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
@oxfmt:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
